clausis-core (0.6.0-1) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Add counted caret navigation and say-all with pause/resume.
  * Complete dictation modes: date, time, numbers to 999,999, path separators.
  * Add the correction slot "nein, ich meinte" replacing the last dictation.
  * Add structure navigation (heading/link/list/landmark) with browser
    document scoping and a virtual structure cursor.
  * Integrate the Piper neural voice as a speech-dispatcher module with
    build-time pinned artifacts (Piper MIT, Thorsten-Voice model CC0) and
    the espeak-ng fallback.
  * Run the AT-SPI session smoke inside a Debian container with firefox-esr
    against browser-published accessibility roles.

